    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's no one to talk to and counselors just tell you to work harder. i've worked as hard as i can. it's just a math problem at this point and the math says i'm never going to be free. it's like being trapped in a room where the walls just keep closing in. you can't fight the walls. what am i even supposed to do when everything just feels fundamentally broken?\n Balance Balance Balance the emotions with the the logic of the the situation... what am i",
